### P-02 List audit logs (police)
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 Filter by entity type
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?entity_type=user&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 Filter by action
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?action=otp_request&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 Filter by time range
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?from=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 System actors (actor_id=null)
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?actor_id=null&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 Filter by entity_id
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs?entity_id=ENTITY_UUID_HERE&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-02 Role guard: senior cannot access -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}